  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A smooth circular groove has a smooth vertical wall as shown in figure. A block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> moves against the wall with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>. Which of the following curve represents the correct relation between the normal reaction on the block by the wall <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>N</mi></mfenced></math> and speed of the block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math>?</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0056_69e4aacbabd1.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 116px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<img src=\"assets\\ot1_0056_b618bffd82ec.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 140px;\" />",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<img src=\"assets\\ot2_0056_dd25548a73d8.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 145px;\" />",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<img src=\"assets\\ot3_0056_ea0fa776e88e.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 142px;\" />",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<img src=\"assets\\ot4_0056_f420d1ebccd2.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 136px;\" />",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The required centripetal force will be provided by the normal reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>This equation is similar to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;which is a parabola.</p></blockquote>"
  }
